From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 14:53:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Start web-font fetches from a style-only resolve

Only the full resolve queued the fetches of @font-face faces that styles had
just started using, so an embedder could not learn which fonts a page needs
without laying it out first. That first layout shaped every paragraph in
fallback fonts, and the faces then forced a second shaping pass.

A style-only resolve now queues the same fetches, as browsers start font loads
at style recalc, so the embedder can wait for the faces and lay out once.
---
 src/resolve.rs | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/resolve.rs b/src/resolve.rs
index e9b2154..19874be 100644
--- a/src/resolve.rs
+++ b/src/resolve.rs
@@ -148,5 +148,8 @@ impl BaseDocument {
         self.flush_pending_device_changes();
         self.flush_slot_assignments();
         self.resolve_stylist(current_time_for_animations);
+        // Start web-font fetches from styles alone, as browsers do, so a caller can wait for the
+        // faces before the first layout instead of shaping every paragraph twice.
+        self.flush_needed_font_faces();
         !self.size_container_seen
     }
